WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.667 --> 00:00:03.801
♪♪

00:00:03.801 --> 00:00:05.734
-Now let's get to the news.

00:00:05.734 --> 00:00:09.067
Russian President Vladimir Putin
is reportedly expected

00:00:09.067 --> 00:00:11.801
to formally declare war
this week on Ukraine.

00:00:11.801 --> 00:00:13.934
Really? Now?

00:00:13.934 --> 00:00:16.234
Putin's like the guy
who's been dating the same woman

00:00:16.234 --> 00:00:18.934
for six months
but refuses to say girlfriend.

00:00:18.934 --> 00:00:23.067
Ukraine has its own dresser,
drawer in your apartment.

00:00:23.067 --> 00:00:25.234
You're at war.
[ Laughter ]

00:00:25.234 --> 00:00:28.100
President Biden last week
named Karine Jean-Pierre

00:00:28.100 --> 00:00:29.634
as the next White House
press secretary,

00:00:29.634 --> 00:00:31.033
which makes her
the first Black woman

00:00:31.033 --> 00:00:33.300
and openly gay person
to hold the position.

00:00:33.300 --> 00:00:36.367
So she's going to spend a lot
of time at the podium saying,

00:00:36.367 --> 00:00:38.968
no, I mean,
questions about world events.

00:00:38.968 --> 00:00:41.634
[ Laughter ]

00:00:41.634 --> 00:00:44.534
The Biden administration issued
a warning over the weekend

00:00:44.534 --> 00:00:47.767
that the country may see 100
million coronavirus infections

00:00:47.767 --> 00:00:50.467
this fall and winter
unless we, as a nation,

00:00:50.467 --> 00:00:53.367
commit to going out and
catching it this summer instead.

00:00:53.367 --> 00:00:55.601
[ Laughter ]

00:00:55.601 --> 00:00:57.534
Senate Minority Leader
Mitch McConnell

00:00:57.534 --> 00:00:59.367
said in a new interview
that the Supreme Court

00:00:59.367 --> 00:01:01.100
overturning Roe versus Wade

00:01:01.100 --> 00:01:03.501
could pave the way
for a national ban on abortion.

00:01:03.501 --> 00:01:06.334
On the bright side, Mexico
might finally pay for a wall.

00:01:06.334 --> 00:01:10.067
[ Laughter ]

00:01:10.067 --> 00:01:13.067
At a rally held by former
President Trump last week,

00:01:13.067 --> 00:01:16.033
Pennsylvania Republican Senate
candidate Dr. Mehmet Oz

00:01:16.033 --> 00:01:17.901
was repeatedly booed
by the crowd.

00:01:17.901 --> 00:01:21.167
In his defense, that's just how
Pennsylvania says hello.

00:01:21.167 --> 00:01:24.234
[ Laughter ]

00:01:24.234 --> 00:01:26.067
The CDC announced
over the weekend

00:01:26.067 --> 00:01:28.667
that it's investigating
a recent coronavirus outbreak

00:01:28.667 --> 00:01:30.067
on a Carnival cruise ship.

00:01:30.067 --> 00:01:33.033
That might be the shortest
investigation ever conducted.

00:01:33.033 --> 00:01:34.934
It's a cruise ship, you say?

00:01:34.934 --> 00:01:37.501
Well, I think we've figured
out your problem.

00:01:37.501 --> 00:01:40.000
[ Laughter ]

00:01:40.000 --> 00:01:43.501
U2's Bono and The Edge held
a surprise concert yesterday

00:01:43.501 --> 00:01:45.033
at a subway station in Ukraine.

00:01:45.033 --> 00:01:46.601
If you're curious how it went,

00:01:46.601 --> 00:01:48.901
check your iTunes.
It's already in there.

00:01:48.901 --> 00:01:50.667
[ Laughter ]

00:01:50.667 --> 00:01:51.901
They probably didn't think
that decision

00:01:51.901 --> 00:01:53.801
would have
such a long tail.

00:01:53.801 --> 00:01:57.000
Is that a decade?
It's like a decade ago now.

00:01:57.000 --> 00:01:58.467
What's the worst
that can happen?

00:01:58.467 --> 00:02:01.501
They're still making jokes
about it 10 years from now.

00:02:01.501 --> 00:02:03.634
What a good Bono.

00:02:03.634 --> 00:02:05.467
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:02:05.467 --> 00:02:07.133
Good Bono.

00:02:08.901 --> 00:02:10.901
I feel like you roll your eyes
at me, Wally.

00:02:10.901 --> 00:02:12.567
[ Laughter ]

00:02:14.801 --> 00:02:16.734
And finally, a family
in Massachusetts

00:02:16.734 --> 00:02:18.000
recently rescued a puppy

00:02:18.000 --> 00:02:19.601
that they found
on the side of the road,

00:02:19.601 --> 00:02:21.400
which was actually
a baby coyote.

00:02:21.400 --> 00:02:23.901
Said the family,
I guess it's for the best.

00:02:23.901 --> 00:02:25.934
It didn't get along
with our cat anyway.

00:02:25.934 --> 00:02:28.200
[ Laughter ]

00:02:29.267 --> 00:02:30.934
Thanks to the family
who posed for that photo.

00:02:30.934 --> 00:02:32.734
♪♪

00:02:32.734 --> 00:02:35.100
President Biden today
held a bilateral meeting

00:02:35.100 --> 00:02:37.434
with Italian
Prime Minister Mario Draghi

00:02:37.434 --> 00:02:40.434
to reaffirm the partnership
between the two countries.

00:02:40.434 --> 00:02:43.534
Though I think he misunderstood
which partnership.

00:02:43.534 --> 00:02:46.200
[ Laughter ]

00:02:46.200 --> 00:02:47.968
President Biden has reportedly

00:02:47.968 --> 00:02:49.667
told his national
security officials

00:02:49.667 --> 00:02:51.834
that recent press leaks
about intelligence sharing

00:02:51.834 --> 00:02:53.601
with Ukraine need to stop

00:02:53.601 --> 00:02:55.701
and could further
inflame tensions with Russia.

00:02:55.701 --> 00:02:59.000
So remember, the Ukrainian
people have our full support,

00:02:59.000 --> 00:03:02.734
but if anyone asks,
no, they don't.

00:03:02.734 --> 00:03:05.267
Congressional Republicans
are reportedly split over

00:03:05.267 --> 00:03:07.767
what to do if the Supreme Court
officially overturns

00:03:07.767 --> 00:03:08.901
Roe versus Wade.

00:03:08.901 --> 00:03:10.167
Apparently, they can't decide

00:03:10.167 --> 00:03:14.567
between a ticker tape parade
or a dance party.

00:03:14.567 --> 00:03:16.834
[ Laughter ]

00:03:18.400 --> 00:03:19.701
I think it's a very fair point,

00:03:19.701 --> 00:03:21.567
but I understand why
it was a huge bummer.

00:03:21.567 --> 00:03:23.667
[ Laughter ]

00:03:23.667 --> 00:03:26.300
The Senate passed a bill
yesterday to expand security

00:03:26.300 --> 00:03:28.934
for Supreme Court justices,
and just in time.

00:03:28.934 --> 00:03:32.367
Did you see how close that
lunatic got to Clarence Thomas?

00:03:32.367 --> 00:03:34.367
[ Laughter ]

00:03:36.000 --> 00:03:38.801
150 personal items
that belonged to the late

00:03:38.801 --> 00:03:41.000
Supreme Court Justice
Ruth Bader Ginsburg

00:03:41.000 --> 00:03:43.667
recently sold in an auction
for over $800,000,

00:03:43.667 --> 00:03:46.300
though I think some of
Kavanaugh's stuff got mixed in.

00:03:46.300 --> 00:03:48.534
[ Laughter ]

00:03:48.534 --> 00:03:50.968
Authorities in Texas
are looking for a man

00:03:50.968 --> 00:03:54.200
who allegedly burglarized a home
and then mowed the front

00:03:54.200 --> 00:03:56.334
and back lawns
before fleeing the scene.

00:03:56.334 --> 00:03:59.601
Police describe
the suspect as your dad.

00:03:59.601 --> 00:04:02.234
[ Laughter ]

00:04:02.234 --> 00:04:05.400
A dog that escaped from a yard
in Brooklyn over a week ago

00:04:05.400 --> 00:04:07.367
was spotted swimming
in the East River

00:04:07.367 --> 00:04:09.167
and then walking through
the Battery Tunnel

00:04:09.167 --> 00:04:11.567
before he was rescued
from the parking lot

00:04:11.567 --> 00:04:13.234
of a Home Depot in New Jersey.

00:04:13.234 --> 00:04:14.934
Though I'm not sure rescued
is the right word.

00:04:14.934 --> 00:04:16.901
It sounds more like
he was apprehended.

00:04:16.901 --> 00:04:18.434
[ Laughter ]

00:04:18.434 --> 00:04:21.200
Who told you
where to find me?

00:04:21.200 --> 00:04:23.734
Authorities in Nevada
have reported finding

00:04:23.734 --> 00:04:26.167
several sets of human remains
over the last week

00:04:26.167 --> 00:04:30.367
in Lake Mead as water levels
drop amid an ongoing drought.

00:04:30.367 --> 00:04:33.467
On the upside, the Mafia
is now very invested

00:04:33.467 --> 00:04:35.234
in stopping climate change.

00:04:35.234 --> 00:04:37.601
[ Laughter ]

00:04:44.734 --> 00:04:47.133
Artist Andy Warhol
silkscreen portrait

00:04:47.133 --> 00:04:51.567
of Marilyn Monroe sold yesterday
at auction for $195 million

00:04:51.567 --> 00:04:53.701
and at Old Navy for $6.

00:04:53.701 --> 00:04:56.200
[ Laughter ]

00:04:56.200 --> 00:04:59.167
And finally, Starbucks added
a new drink to its menu today,

00:04:59.167 --> 00:05:02.434
which is cold brew coffee
topped with chocolate foam

00:05:02.434 --> 00:05:04.267
and sweetened
with vanilla syrup.

00:05:04.267 --> 00:05:08.067
It's also their first drink
to come with the bathroom key.

00:05:08.067 --> 00:05:10.400
[ Laughter ]

00:05:11.300 --> 00:05:13.667
President Biden spoke today
in Illinois

00:05:13.667 --> 00:05:16.334
about his administration's
plan to support farmers.

00:05:16.334 --> 00:05:18.133
Although I feel like
he should be asking

00:05:18.133 --> 00:05:20.067
about their plan to support him.

00:05:20.067 --> 00:05:23.501
Do you guys got one of those
"Charlotte's Web" spiders

00:05:23.501 --> 00:05:25.234
that could write
something nice about me?

00:05:25.234 --> 00:05:27.767
[ Laughter ]

00:05:27.767 --> 00:05:29.767
Well, speaking yesterday
at the White House

00:05:29.767 --> 00:05:32.000
about the steps
he's taking to curb inflation,

00:05:32.000 --> 00:05:34.734
President Biden acknowledged
the Democrats

00:05:34.734 --> 00:05:36.767
"control all three branches
of the government."

00:05:36.767 --> 00:05:40.300
Oh, so you are aware?

00:05:40.300 --> 00:05:42.167
It's like hearing
a six-year-old say

00:05:42.167 --> 00:05:44.300
Genesis was better
with Peter Gabriel.

00:05:44.300 --> 00:05:50.067
Definitely.
We just didn't know you knew.

00:05:50.067 --> 00:05:52.934
Bill Gates announced yesterday
that he has tested positive

00:05:52.934 --> 00:05:54.801
for a breakthrough case
of the coronavirus.

00:05:54.801 --> 00:05:57.067
Gates says
he probably got the virus

00:05:57.067 --> 00:05:59.133
because he forgot
to install McAfee.

00:05:59.133 --> 00:06:01.200
[ Laughter ]

00:06:04.901 --> 00:06:08.367
That's right, Bill Gates has
tested positive for coronavirus.

00:06:08.367 --> 00:06:11.167
So for now, he's just going
to attend meetings on Zoom.

00:06:11.167 --> 00:06:14.167
Oh, I mean, Microsoft Teams!

00:06:14.167 --> 00:06:17.834
We all -- we love
Microsoft Teams, everybody.

00:06:20.100 --> 00:06:22.367
A House intelligence
subcommittee is set next week

00:06:22.367 --> 00:06:25.234
to hold the first open
congressional hearing on UFOs.

00:06:25.234 --> 00:06:26.501
Oh, come on.

00:06:26.501 --> 00:06:28.968
How many times are you going
to make him testify?

00:06:28.968 --> 00:06:31.234
[ Laughter ]

00:06:31.234 --> 00:06:33.801
According to newly
released audio

00:06:33.801 --> 00:06:36.033
from an interview
after the Capitol attack,

00:06:36.033 --> 00:06:38.167
Republican Senator
Lindsey Graham praised

00:06:38.167 --> 00:06:40.367
President Biden
and said he's the

00:06:40.367 --> 00:06:42.501
"best person to have in office."

00:06:42.501 --> 00:06:43.734
And then today he said,

00:06:43.734 --> 00:06:45.467
"I'm going to let
that go to voicemail."

00:06:45.467 --> 00:06:47.801
[ Laughter ]

00:06:47.801 --> 00:06:50.434
Actor James Cromwell
super glued himself

00:06:50.434 --> 00:06:52.400
to the counter
of a Starbucks in New York

00:06:52.400 --> 00:06:53.968
yesterday
to protest the chain

00:06:53.968 --> 00:06:56.133
charging more
for plant-based milks.

00:06:56.133 --> 00:06:57.801
While over a Dunkin',

00:06:57.801 --> 00:07:00.267
You kind of just stick
to the counter naturally.

00:07:00.267 --> 00:07:03.067
[ Laughter ]

00:07:03.067 --> 00:07:05.234
Thank you very much.

00:07:05.234 --> 00:07:07.667
[ Laughter ]

00:07:17.367 --> 00:07:20.400
Two unoccupied beach houses
in North Carolina

00:07:20.400 --> 00:07:22.000
recently fell into the ocean,

00:07:22.000 --> 00:07:26.667
or, as the realtor put it,
360-degree ocean views.

00:07:26.667 --> 00:07:29.968
[ Laughter ]

00:07:29.968 --> 00:07:32.501
A rat ran on to the field
during last night's

00:07:32.501 --> 00:07:33.634
New York Mets game.

00:07:33.634 --> 00:07:35.501
A staff member
quickly caught it,

00:07:35.501 --> 00:07:38.133
and out of habit, tossed it
to a kid in the front row.

00:07:38.133 --> 00:07:40.400
[ Laughter ]

00:07:44.934 --> 00:07:47.801
Hi, Baseball rat.

00:07:47.801 --> 00:07:49.400
I got a baseball rat.

00:07:51.834 --> 00:07:54.801
And finally, an alligator
was recently spotted

00:07:54.801 --> 00:07:56.267
in the drive through
of a fast food

00:07:56.267 --> 00:07:57.634
restaurant in North Carolina.

00:07:57.634 --> 00:08:02.100
But this is annoying.
He had no idea what he wanted.

00:08:02.100 --> 00:08:04.701
Let's go!

00:08:04.701 --> 00:08:06.300
Let's go!
You're holding up the line!

00:08:08.067 --> 00:08:10.234
In his new book,
Ex-Defense Secretary

00:08:10.234 --> 00:08:12.934
Mark Esper writes that
despite his hatred

00:08:12.934 --> 00:08:14.767
of press leaks,
former President Trump

00:08:14.767 --> 00:08:17.033
was "the biggest leaker of all."

00:08:17.033 --> 00:08:19.200
Said Trump,
"Well, that's the last time

00:08:19.200 --> 00:08:21.334
I show him
the Area 51 aliens.

00:08:21.334 --> 00:08:22.934
Oh, damn it."

00:08:22.934 --> 00:08:24.567
[ Laughter ]

00:08:24.567 --> 00:08:26.200
President Biden criticized

00:08:26.200 --> 00:08:28.234
Republicans at a fundraiser
last night

00:08:28.234 --> 00:08:29.868
for their recent
attacks on Disney

00:08:29.868 --> 00:08:31.901
and said "they're going to storm

00:08:31.901 --> 00:08:34.133
Cinderella's castle
before this is over."

00:08:34.133 --> 00:08:35.467
Oh, buddy, I hate to tell you.

00:08:35.467 --> 00:08:37.133
If they're storming anything,

00:08:37.133 --> 00:08:40.567
it's the Hall of Presidents.

00:08:40.567 --> 00:08:43.133
Also, that's me, right?

00:08:43.133 --> 00:08:45.400
[ Laughter ]

00:08:51.501 --> 00:08:54.400
I mean, imagine finding --

00:08:54.400 --> 00:08:58.534
That's how I found out
I was a president.

00:08:58.534 --> 00:09:01.868
[ Laughter ]

00:09:01.868 --> 00:09:03.267
President Biden told a small

00:09:03.267 --> 00:09:05.567
gathering at a Democratic
fundraiser last night

00:09:05.567 --> 00:09:07.534
that it's going to be hard
to maintain the majority

00:09:07.534 --> 00:09:09.601
in both houses of Congress,
especially since

00:09:09.601 --> 00:09:12.734
they don't have it
in the first place.

00:09:12.734 --> 00:09:14.534
Arizona Senator
Kyrsten Sinema

00:09:14.534 --> 00:09:16.267
appeared on the Senate
floor yesterday

00:09:16.267 --> 00:09:19.167
wearing a pink tie-dyed shirt
that said "no thanks."

00:09:19.167 --> 00:09:21.200
I don't know what that means

00:09:21.200 --> 00:09:23.300
except that Arizona
elected a senator

00:09:23.300 --> 00:09:24.901
who only shops at airports.

00:09:24.901 --> 00:09:26.868
[ Laughter ]

00:09:26.868 --> 00:09:31.100
Even weirder,
Bernie Sanders was wearing this.

00:09:31.100 --> 00:09:34.734
[ Laughter ]

00:09:34.734 --> 00:09:37.033
I need it. I don't know
what to tell you.

00:09:37.033 --> 00:09:39.667
I need it.

00:09:39.667 --> 00:09:42.501
I'm not going to apologize.

00:09:42.501 --> 00:09:43.701
Mama needs wine.

00:09:43.701 --> 00:09:45.701
[ Laughter ]

00:09:45.701 --> 00:09:48.501
President Biden today called
Ferdinand Marcos Jr.

00:09:48.501 --> 00:09:49.701
to congratulate him
on winning

00:09:49.701 --> 00:09:51.267
the Philippine
presidential election.

00:09:51.267 --> 00:09:53.968
Said Biden, "Remember,
winning is the easy part.

00:09:53.968 --> 00:09:56.267
The hard part
is convincing everybody

00:09:56.267 --> 00:09:58.133
that you actually won."

00:09:58.133 --> 00:09:59.834
[ Laughter ]

00:09:59.834 --> 00:10:01.133
While speaking yesterday,

00:10:01.133 --> 00:10:03.167
the thousands of union
electrical workers,

00:10:03.167 --> 00:10:05.267
President Biden referred
to former President Trump

00:10:05.267 --> 00:10:07.234
as "the great MAGA king."

00:10:07.234 --> 00:10:10.601
Okay, can we please
not give him any more ideas?

00:10:10.601 --> 00:10:12.234
[ Laughter ]

00:10:12.234 --> 00:10:15.100
North Korea reported its
first coronavirus outbreak today

00:10:15.100 --> 00:10:18.434
and ordered all cities and
counties to enter a lockdown,

00:10:18.434 --> 00:10:20.868
or as they call it,
business as usual.

00:10:20.868 --> 00:10:23.801
[ Laughter ]

00:10:23.801 --> 00:10:25.467
New York Mayor Eric Adams

00:10:25.467 --> 00:10:27.701
said on Tuesday
that his official residence,

00:10:27.701 --> 00:10:29.801
Gracie Mansion, is haunted
and added

00:10:29.801 --> 00:10:32.901
"I don't care what anyone says.
There are ghosts in there."

00:10:32.901 --> 00:10:38.701
Mm, I don't think that's
who's booing you.

00:10:38.701 --> 00:10:42.467
According to a new study,
the top three baby names

00:10:42.467 --> 00:10:44.634
that are set to make
a comeback this year are

00:10:44.634 --> 00:10:46.801
Joan, Mary and Margaret,

00:10:46.801 --> 00:10:50.334
which is also a full curse
in a Catholic household.

00:10:50.334 --> 00:10:52.868
Oh, Joan, Mary and Margaret!

00:10:52.868 --> 00:10:54.934
[ Laughter ]

00:10:56.801 --> 00:10:58.534
In fact...

00:10:58.534 --> 00:10:59.567
[ Laughter ]

00:10:59.567 --> 00:11:01.634
I stubbed me toe!

00:11:01.634 --> 00:11:03.701
[ Laughter ]

00:11:06.434 --> 00:11:08.734
So, Bill, I've got a little bit
of criticism

00:11:08.734 --> 00:11:13.367
recently about my
really good Irish accent.

00:11:13.367 --> 00:11:16.067
And finally, the New York State
Lottery announced yesterday

00:11:16.067 --> 00:11:18.000
that the results
of Tuesday's drawing

00:11:18.000 --> 00:11:20.868
were published with the wrong
mega ball number,

00:11:20.868 --> 00:11:23.200
and things are pretty
awkward at the house

00:11:23.200 --> 00:11:24.367
that thought they won.

00:11:24.367 --> 00:11:26.934
Honey, I was joking
about the divorce.

00:11:26.934 --> 00:11:29.934
That was ha-ha, it's me.

00:11:29.934 --> 00:11:33.000
That's when I'm funny.

00:11:33.000 --> 00:11:34.334
That was a monologue,
everybody.

00:11:34.334 --> 00:11:39.234
♪♪

